<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks drop to 75,237.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks drop to 75,237.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of November 8 totaled 75,237 bales, down from 76,048 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, no decertification orders, 811 cancellations, and 100 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
